                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Note I have recieved a key from the Developer.\n\nThis is the second time I've reviewed this game. And It is the second time I'll leave a negative review\n\nPros:\n-Everything is made of cardboard\n-The game tries a lot of genres\n-The best i've seen from Blender game engine.\n It tries to run smoothly...Color me impressed\n\nCons:\n-EXTREMELY BUGGY\n ESPECIALLY THE TUTORIAL!\n Not to mention it crashes almost all the time\n-Short on content\n-The engrish is so bad. \"You need a more house\"?\n I can not understand the story.\n-Terrible Interface, not a lot of visual feedback to tell what's right and what's wrong.\n The Continue button should be hidden if there isn't a save game,\n\nThe concept is pretty cool. But that's all this game is. A concept.",
